{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1242686-so-ctl-2e-how-is-it","id":1242686,"title":"So... CtL 2e. How is it?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-08-04T04:57:26-07:00","id":1242686,"title":"So... CtL 2e. How is it?","content":"At the time of the Kickstarter i couldn't back CtL 2e, so all I know about it comes from the previews I've read here. So, now that it's been released to the backers... how is it? I haven't seen any review yet, and I'm mighty curious. Does it hold up to first edition? Do you think there's something that it's missing? How is the art? Would have you done something differently? Do <i>you </i>like it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Italian nuisance. English is my second language, so be patient!<br /> <br /> <b>My homebrew:</b><br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/270766-domain-light-from-a-dead-star-rome\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">[VtR 2e] Light From a Dead Star: Rome</span></a></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1117941-hunting-ground-the-past-is-another-country-rome\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#8B4513\"><b>[WtF 2e] The Past Is Another Country: Rome</b></span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3765-snesferatu","name":"SNESferatu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3765_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T07:47:11-07:00","id":1242716,"title":"","content":"At the very least, I think it\u2019s well worth the time spent waiting. The updated rules are much more concise, the focus for the book is stronger and the feel for the game almost feels more mature, if that makes sense. While there are some things that aren\u2019t in the core book that Changeling 1e had, comparatively 2e is still stronger than the 1e core book is, and 2e has had plenty of time to develop content. Word count has meant that some content is a little sparse but very rich - we only have twelve Kiths, for example, but those Kiths are chock full of lore and mechanics that make each one really unique to play, rather than a simple bonus. The book fortunately does include sections for homebrewing your own content, and though I wish that was a little beefed up it works fine for me. Art is definitely a high point for the book too - soothing greens on top of some very well done art, especially for the Kiths mentioned above. Much of it will be familiar to the Kickstarter backers, but it\u2019s good art so it\u2019s hardly a detriment.<br /> <br /> Overall, I very much like Changeling 2e, and I recommend pre-ordering it and getting access to the pre-errata documents. Even without the few typos corrected, the book is very well put together and easily able to run a game with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T12:15:56-07:00","id":1242766,"title":"","content":"I'm still reading myself, but I'm really enjoying what I'm reading and am excited to run a game using it. Taidragon is spot on with my own opinion. I love the new expanded take on Kiths. Also note that the Kickstarter had an addon called Kith &amp; Kin PDF, which had it's content expanded via several stretch goals. The basic addon adds rules and options for Kiths. Thanks to the stretch goals it'll include content for Crown, Jewels, and Mirrors Regalia. A number of other supplemental PDFs were added as well. I'd imagine these things will be available on DriveThru as perhaps a 2e companion pdf around the time the book officially releases.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1824-xaielao","name":"Xaielao","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1824_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T12:49:23-07:00","id":1242774,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure we'll see the Companion that soon (it's still in redlines) since the CtL 2e team is focusing on the quickstart first, and the CtL 2e core book should be available to everyone fairly soon.<br /> <br /> Just to make sure things are clear for people that didn't follow the Kickstarter, there are two main supplements the Kickstarter funded. The first is the Companion, which expands on things like Freeholds, Courts, Tokens, and so on. The second is the Kith book, which is going to add a lot more Kiths to the game (and I believe more than just a giant book of Kiths, but discussions to expand on creating your own and/or other topics).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T14:09:30-07:00","id":1242785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xaielao</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1242686-so-ctl-2e-how-is-it?p=1242766#post1242766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks to the stretch goals it'll include content for Crown, Jewels, and Mirrors Regalia.</div> </div> </div> </div>...in addition to Shield, Steed and Sword Regalia kiths.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T15:26:23-07:00","id":1242798,"title":"","content":"The Companion PDF's are in redlining? I'd like to see them sooner, but I get that they need to get the book &amp; quickstart out to everyone first. <br /> <br /> I forgot about those ones Tasti <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1824-xaielao","name":"Xaielao","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1824_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-06T21:33:48-07:00","id":1243395,"title":"","content":"So, is second edition out, then?<br /> <br /> I've been holding off on buying <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/50010/Changeling-The-Lost\" target=\"_blank\">the book</a> while I waited for its release! <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-06T21:48:39-07:00","id":1243400,"title":"","content":"The 2e backer PDF is out to the backers for the fan errata pass. The final version hasn't been released yet,a nd your link is to the 1e book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-06T22:06:37-07:00","id":1243402,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1242686-so-ctl-2e-how-is-it?p=1243400#post1243400\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The final version hasn't been released yet,a nd your link is to the 1e book.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That's what I was afraid of. It says it's a second version printing, so I was confused. <br /> <br /> Eagerly waiting to see the second edition appear on the site in the future.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-06T23:38:45-07:00","id":1243417,"title":"","content":"It's a second printing in the sense that it's a second version of the 1e core that had some errata included.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}